<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner plans no Spanish shipyard buys.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner plans no Spanish shipyard buys.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Norwegian industrial group Kvaerner ASA denied on Wednesday it had expressed an interest in buying shipyards in Spain.</p>
<p>&quot;This is not true. We are not interested in buying any shipyards in Spain now,&quot; Kvaerner spokeswoman Marit Ytreeide told Reuters.</p>
<p>A report by Lloyd's List trade newspaper at the weekend said Kvaerner had declared an interest in buying shipyards when Spain's Astilleros Espanoles is privatised.</p>
<p>It said Kvaerner had informed the country's Ministry of Industry of its interest.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
